    "updated_at": "2024-07-29T22:44:39Z",
    "body": "Also note \r\n\r\n*  [Gecko - Consider supporting `-webkit-fill-available` as an alias for `-moz-available` (extended to work in the height axis)](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1872755)\r\n* [Gecko - [css-sizing-4] Implement `stretch` keyword for sizing properties)](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1789477)\r\n*  [WebKit - Implement stretch css sizing value (-webkit-fill-available))](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=277117)\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
